 "readme": {
  "file": "README.md",
  "title": "Balaban's low-temperature renormalization group for O(N) spin models, in Lean 4",
  "excerpt": "This repository is a formalization in progress, in [Lean 4](https://lean-lang.org/) with [Mathlib](https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4), of Tadeusz Balaban's renormalization-group analysis of the classical O(N) spin model at low temperature. The papers it follows were published in 1995–1999, the last two with Michael O'Carroll; [docs/PAPERS.md](docs/PAPERS.md) lists them."
 },
